Package: scAnnotationPipeline
Type: Package
Title: scRNA-seq Standardization, Clustering, Annotation, and CNA Pipeline
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Internal Shiny application and utility functions for
    standardizing, clustering, differential-expression analysis, manual
    annotation, and copy-number alteration analysis of single-cell RNA-seq
    cancer datasets. This DESCRIPTION file supports devtools and testthat
    tooling around the application code; the application itself is run
    directly with shiny::runApp(".") from the repository root rather than
    installed as a conventional R package. Utility functions remain in
    util_scripts/ and are sourced by both app.R and the test suite.
